{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:38 2026-10-09 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:00 2026-10-09 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:00 2026-10-09 HKT</p><p>東北季候風正影響廣東沿岸。</p><p>本港地區今日大致天晴。日間乾燥，市區最高氣溫約30度，新界再高一兩度。吹和緩至清勁東至東北風，初時離岸間中吹強風。</p><img alt=\"本港地區今日大致天晴。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/124153ee62d79db13eb284bd467ffb11/2026-10/10_0_0.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b68ce836f97f50a895d0d8bc14fd808/2026-10/2026-10-09_00_35_18.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d97be053eaf2725d6327e014a35ce8f2/2026-10/2026-10-09_00_35_28.png\"/><img alt=\"本港地區今日大致天晴。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f26ae0a3ef3f17dba803c512d21a549b/2026-10/11.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"本港地區今日大致天晴。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a1e70dfd98ad3150ac17adac1408d2e/2026-10/9_0.jpeg\"/><p>展望明日至下週中期持續天晴乾燥，內陸地區日夜溫差較大。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T23:59:02.523488+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}